1. EXECUTIVE OVERVIEW
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The Vigilance Educational Platform (tutor.vigilance.rw) is an adaptive cognitive 
learning environment integrated across higher-education and partner secondary 
institutions. This document outlines the active user classifications, traction 
metrics, authentication telemetry, access governance, and cognitive distribution 
of all active entities operating across the database and application layers.

Primary Institutional Deployments:
  * Excel International Academy (Signed Partnership Agreement)
  * Vigilance Educational Network
  * University of Rwanda (UR)
  * Carnegie Mellon University Africa (CMU Africa)
  * University of Kigali (UoK)
  * University of the People (UoPeople)
  * Isange Digital Academy


2. USER ROLES & ACCESS CLASSIFICATIONS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The platform maintains three strictly isolated user classifications enforced 
via PostgreSQL Row Level Security (RLS) and Supabase Auth JWT claims:

2.1. ADMINISTRATORS (admin)
  - Scope: Global system governance, AI model orchestration, and security telemetry.
  - Active Capabilities:
      • Real-time system monitoring & weekly activity audit trail (1,000+ live logs).
      • User verification, educator credentials approval, and suspension/banning.
      • Permanent account cascading deletions with foreign key purge protocols.
      • Global Gemini API key configuration and cognitive temperature controls.
      • Universal indexing across all system profiles, materials, and flashcards.

2.2. EDUCATORS & TEACHERS (teacher)
  - Scope: Classroom cohort management, curriculum material publishing, and evaluation.
  - Active Capabilities:
      • Multi-classroom management and student cohort roster tracking.
      • Study material uploads (PDF, Slides, Word, Audio, Video, YouTube, Link).
      • Adaptive quiz creation and evaluation benchmarks.
      • Real-time student cognitive velocity and confidence telemetry inspection.

2.3. STUDENTS & LEARNERS (student)
  - Scope: Personalized socratic tutoring, active retrieval, and automated notebook.
  - Active Capabilities:
      • Interactive conversational study workspace powered by Google Gemini.
      • Digital Notebook with markdown formatting, AI summaries, and tag extraction.
      • Spaced-retrieval Flashcard sets with active recall tracking.
      • Brain Teasers, daily challenges, and self-rated confidence quiz loops.
      • Customizable cognitive interfaces (ADHD, Dyslexia, Sensory, Standard).


