5. COGNITIVE MODES & ACCESSIBILITY PROFILES
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Active student profiles support multi-modal cognitive accessibility preferences:

  * Standard Mode:
      Balanced contrast, streamlined typography, standard spacing.
  * ADHD Adaptive Mode:
      Bite-sized breakdown chunks, high visual anchors, micro-progress rewards.
  * Dyslexia-Friendly Mode:
      Specialized OpenDyslexic typography, increased letter tracking, soft contrast.
  * Sensory Calming Mode:
      Warm pastel overlays (sepia, warm cream), reduced motion, low cognitive load.


6. SECURITY, BANNING & DATA CASUS DELETION
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
6.1. Ban / Suspension Protocol:
  - When an account is marked as `approval_status = 'banned'`, login attempts 
    are intercepted immediately at `src/routes/auth.sign-in.tsx`.
  - Active browser sessions are terminated immediately via `AppShell` session 
    invalidation, preventing unauthorized AI tutor calls.

6.2. Cascade Deletion Protocol (`admin_delete_user` RPC):
  - Permanent account deletion executes a clean transactional purge across all 
    11 relational tables:
      1. `classroom_students` (student junction)
      2. `quiz_attempts` (scores and telemetry)
      3. `notes` (digital notebook records)
      4. `flashcard_decks` (flashcard sets)
      5. `materials` (uploaded documents)
      6. `user_logs` (audit telemetry)
      7. `student_profiles` (cognitive settings)
      8. `note_shares` (peer share junctions)
      9. `favorites` (user bookmarks)
     10. `chat_sessions` (AI conversational history)
     11. `profiles` & `auth.users` (core identity records)


7. SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE & INTEGRATION PARTNERS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * Cloud Infrastructure: Google Cloud Platform (GCP)
  * Database & Auth    : Supabase (PostgreSQL 15 with Realtime & Row Level Security)
  * Email Delivery     : Resend Transactional Engine
  * Client Partners    : Excel International Academy (Signed Agreement), Vigilance System (purelearn.vigilance.rw)

